From 55d312e6a3d9c5bdf5ae20bb1e2bad98edc38f03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 04:28:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/10] Remove references to excluded apps from framework

Remove Auditor references:
- Remove app.attestation.auditor from GmcPackageManager HIDDEN_PACKAGES
- Remove bundled Auditor app certificate digest from
  read_additional_security_state_known_signers
- Remove app.attestation.auditor from notification permission grants
Auditor relies on hardware attestation and will never pass on a GSI.

Remove SELinux flags kernel support notification:
The GSI does not ship a GrapheneOS-patched kernel so the custom
SELinux flags proc attribute will never be present. Remove the
persistent notification since it is expected and not actionable.

Remove MusicFX references:
MusicFX is excluded from the build. Remove stale hidden API whitelist
and privileged app permissions entries.
